== Resolve and freeze the invocation ==
Caller -> C : POST Skill command
C -> S : selected real Skill Definition
S -> I : resolve complete Agent / body / binding version
S -> S : validate expansion budget and trust boundary
S -> A : original user input + internal expansion snapshot
group Owning admission transaction
  A -> D : recheck access / binding / idle / capacity
  A -> D : append original public user event + private context\nregister root event and set running
  D --> A : committed receipt and fixed execution
end
== Execute the accepted root ==
A --> Caller : SSE: original user.message first
A -> R : execute with in-memory credentials
R -> D : ordered complete events / safe projection
R --> Caller : same root sourceEventId; preview best-effort
R -> D : confirming boundary or actual terminal
R --> Caller : matching idle; close response
== Reconcile through history ==
Caller -> Q : GET Events
Q -> D : read visible complete history
D --> Q : original invocation and output
Q --> Caller : history; private Skill body omitted
note over I,D
  Freeze parsed body and metadata for this
  invocation.
  Recheck mutable bindings under owning locks
  before acceptance.
  Keep recoverable expansion in existing private
  Session context.
  No separate Skill full-text audit copy; use
  deployment retention.
  No raw credential persistence or automatic
  side-effect replay.
end note
@enduml
